# Claude Code's own runtime state, not project source — launch.json points
# at a venv path on one particular machine, which is nobody else's business
# and wrong everywhere but here.
.claude/
#  Anything holding a password, wherever it was dropped. initpwd.txt was
#  put in this directory to be READ, and a `git add -A` committed and
#  pushed it -- so the rule is now a pattern rather than a filename,
#  because the next one will be called something else.
initpwd.txt
*password*.txt
*passwd*.txt
*.secret
*credentials*
app/data/template-packages/
preview-emails.html
